io2dlNRQggOe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> M&ocirc; tả thị phần của OS 2 v&agrave; OS 3</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> C&aacute;ch viết từng c&acirc;u:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WmZmdTBuno2TMIx2y6zl9EQGgRd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcOkdRMB3oglFQx3YSslSvXpgbe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VzPUdBpFmosYQyx4NFOl79YRgKh\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLrHdc701owzfzxHR4Al2Nq3ggc\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"10\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"11\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"12\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng như sau:</span></div>\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PaNsdg4aJoiIzmxn90MlYcMmgph\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IogQdHLsUooNhux9kqGlkHE0g8c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\n<h4><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1</strong>: <strong>OS 1 v&agrave; other OSs</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ULggdzzDGoH4SXxQcDWlXSZsg3d\"><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Năm 2012, <strong>Others</strong> chiếm 48% (gần một nửa thị trường) trong khi <strong>OS 1</strong> chỉ c&oacute; 20%</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BEPvdt67Los6a3xchw6l6Bydgjg\"><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Qua c&aacute;c năm sau, <strong>OS 1 </strong>tăng l&ecirc;n 38% (2013) &rarr; 47% (2014) &rarr; đạt đỉnh 52% (2015)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZtwJdNguvopKmkxnjN7lLX0sgZe\"><strong>C&acirc;u 3:</strong> Thị phần <strong>other OSs</strong> giảm từ 48% xuống 35% (2013) &rarr; 23% (2014) &rarr; chỉ c&ograve;n 15% (2015)</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZcihdwAPvowS7nxjhyjldzXYgPd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2: OS 2 v&agrave; OS 3</strong></span></h4>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HIqld9Uv3oJjTlx1ololGtVTg3c\"><strong>C&acirc;u 1: OS 2</strong> chiếm 17% v&agrave; <strong>OS 3</strong> chiếm 15% trong năm 2012</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HIqld9Uv3oJjTlx1ololGtVTg3c\"><strong>C&acirc;u 2: OS 2 </strong>duy tr&igrave; ở 17% (2013) &rarr; tăng nhẹ l&ecirc;n 18% (2014 v&agrave; 2015)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HIqld9Uv3oJjTlx1ololGtVTg3c\"><strong>C&acirc;u 3:</strong> <strong>OS 3</strong> giảm xuống 10% (2013) &rarr; phục hồi l&ecirc;n 12% (2014) &rarr; trở lại 15% (2015)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FzcsdRMXSoU9ngxhPmbljcEIgZf\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cdq8dRrBqoMznvx8iOGlamn5ghe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Paraphrasing &amp; Vocabulary:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GLbhdbCKwovei2xJSsEld7p6gXg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPvMdqRXDoplk8xtrh1lYqWGgrg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F2Vtd4Bh5o78qrxglSlljNPXgRh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>tăng mạnh</strong>\", m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>substantial growth</li>\n<li>remarkable expansion</li>\n<li>surging</li>\n<li>underwent significant increase</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SHvjdyVBsoST8qxGDbdlhDPEgoU\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SHvjdyVBsoST8qxGDbdlhDPEgoU\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">OS 1 experienced substantial growth throughout the period.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 978,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">The pie charts illustrate the global market share of three computer operating systems and other systems from 2012 to 2015.</div>",
            "question_id": 16235,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 979,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">Overall, OS 1 experienced substantial growth throughout the period while Others showed a dramatic decline. By the end of the period, OS 1 had become the dominant operating system, capturing more than half of the market.</div>",
            "question_id": 16235,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 980,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">Looking at the most dramatically changing categories, in 2012, Others held the largest market share at 48%, which was more than double that of OS 1 at 20%. However, OS 1 underwent remarkable expansion over the four-year period, surging to 38% in 2013, then to 47% in 2014, before reaching its peak of 52% in 2015. In contrast, Others experienced a precipitous decline, plummeting from nearly half of the market to 35% in 2013, then continuing its downward trajectory to 23% in 2014 and finally reaching a mere 15% by 2015.</div>",
            "question_id": 16235,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 981,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2 ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">Regarding the more stable operating systems, OS 2 maintained a relatively consistent market share throughout the period, starting at 17% in 2012 and remaining at this level in 2013, before showing a marginal increase to 18% in both 2014 and 2015. Similarly, OS 3 demonstrated limited variation, beginning at 15% in 2012, dropping to its lowest point of 10% in 2013, then recovering slightly to 12% in 2014 before returning to 15% in the final year.</div>",
            "question_id": 16235,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
